1
00:00:01,910 --> 00:00:08,190
When you are happy with a strategy, you can run it for real.

2
00:00:08,290 --> 00:00:12,610
Select a strategy and click Run.

3
00:00:12,710 --> 00:00:16,960
Choose the account, the timeframe and the instrument.

4
00:00:17,060 --> 00:00:21,820
Check its settings, like the trade size.

5
00:00:21,920 --> 00:00:26,180
Risk controls can cap the lot size or stop it after a drawdown.

6
00:00:26,280 --> 00:00:32,320
Click Run.

7
00:00:32,420 --> 00:00:36,690
It is now running and watching the market for you.

8
00:00:36,790 --> 00:00:40,540
The log shows everything it does.

9
00:00:40,640 --> 00:00:44,530
These tabs show its trades, orders and results so far.

10
00:00:44,630 --> 00:00:48,190
Stats shows its profit, open positions and how long it has run.

11
00:00:48,290 --> 00:00:53,410
Edit Vars changes its settings while it runs.

12
00:00:53,510 --> 00:01:00,280
Pause stops it trading for a while. Resume starts it again.

13
00:01:00,380 --> 00:01:03,520
To stop it, click Stop.

14
00:01:03,620 --> 00:01:07,410
Tick these to close its trades and cancel its orders as it stops.

15
00:01:07,510 --> 00:01:13,720
Only trades this strategy placed are touched.

16
00:01:13,820 --> 00:01:16,720
The strategy has stopped.

